  "plain": "Officials from the Intelligence Community Inspector General, the internal watchdog that oversees America's spy agencies, 'extremely hinted' that humans are not the ones in charge, according to Dylan Borland, a former US intelligence specialist turned whistleblower. Borland tells Michels in 2026 that this happened to him personally, saying he wants to respect the office 'but the ICI did it with me.' If true, an official watchdog quietly signalled that some non-human power runs things."
